e range answers 416 with the total size in `Content-Range`; a malformed Range header is ignored and the full body answers 200.  The same caller-visible gate as every asset endpoint: the owner, or a member of an album the caller sees -- foreign and unknown ids answer byte-identical 404 `ASSET_NOT_FOUND`. 
